{"server":"en","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_06_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_06","title":"Encounter","storyCode":"RI-6","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"72503e7be606e57275709387036838723a7375b16e99057937fd0112119c4837","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Where are the others?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"The people of the Great Wood Tribe are gone. I heard that leader was defeated by an outsider."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Peta","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"The Firestone and Thick Tail Tribes were defeated by an stranger carrying a pile of weapons on her back."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"Some of the tribes decided to join up with Zumama."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"The truth is Zumama's managed to drum up a formidable front. If I weren't with Gavial, I might have gone to Zumama myself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Doesn't matter."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Your tribes will be enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, can we really challenge Zumama on our own?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial can definitely beat Zumama's giant machine. Then, I will become the Great Chief and force Gavial to stay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Peta","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"Peta thinks that is not a good idea."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac12_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But this is the only way to make her stay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Don't forget why we formed 'Gavial's Will'!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"'Gavial's Will' is not just a tribe. It is an alliance dedicated to the vision of Gavial as the Great Chief!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"I agree with Tomimi. I'll only recognize Gavial as the Great Chief."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right, Gavial should be the one to lead us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Clan Leader C","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah, if I disagreed I wouldn't be here either!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Peta","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"...Peta doesn't like it, but Peta will follow."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Alright, you head over to Zumama's tribe and wait outside for me, got it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Other Clan Leaders","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Yes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Right. This is all for Gavial."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Other Clan Leaders","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"All for Gavial!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor! Everyone! Great, I finally found you guys!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"*Sigh*, Doctor, you had me worried."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? Blaze, why are you wearing your swimsuit... and carrying some kid on your back?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I ran into this little girl on my way over here. She started hitting me for some reason."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I kicked her ass, of course, and beat down all her friends too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Gotta hand it to her, she's not bad in a fight, didn't go down easy. So I brought her along. I figured you could help me ask why she wanted to fight me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"It's Kemar. She probably just thought you looked strong. She just loves fighting."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. That means something, coming from you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't love fighting. I'm just a hands-on problem solver."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Whatever."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"...Where... am I...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Morning, Kemar."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"Gavial?! What are you doing here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"You bumped into my friend, fought her, and lost."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh, welcome back, kid."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Hey, Gavial. What's she doing? What's with this bowing?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Kemar, what gives?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"I felt a greater strength from her than anything I ever felt from Zumama."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm not interested in you anymore, Gavial. Looks like you can talk to her, so please, ask her to teach me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, she wants you to teach her."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"What?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"I guess she thinks you're strong, so she wants to become your disciple or something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"...Doctor, what do I do?! I've never been in a situation like this before!"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"It's up to you.","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Nothing to do with me.","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh, how about we just let her follow us for now?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure. Hey, Kemar, come with us."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Flint","speakerId":"char_415_flint","isRemote":false,"text":"But call me Flint."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Come to think of it, what happened to the ceremony?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gavial","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, why don't you explain it to Blaze?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"She'll let her people get Oripathy just to build her machines?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't stand by and let that happen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"What are we waiting for, Doctor? Let's go!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Utage","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait, we still got somewhere to be!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Blaze","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["Blaze"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["Gavial"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["Utage"]},{"speakerId":"char_415_flint","aliases":["Flint"]}]}
